# Host check sample_probe (tests/golden.py): every key of three packs, one note per step (MIDI numbers: '#'
# starts a comment, so sharps can't be written by name).
# kick: the 24-key test kit; snare: a 5-key pack (keys 6-24 clamp to 5); perc: a plain AIFF (one slice);
# sample: the built-in buffer under an explicit samples path; bass: no pack (arg2 0, getSample NULL); lead: a synth
# sample (one slice for every note).
tempo 120
steps 38
tail 0
track kick
sample ../../build/samples/opzk_testkit.aif
note 0 53 0.5
note 1 54 0.5
note 2 55 0.5
note 3 56 0.5
note 4 57 0.5
note 5 58 0.5
note 6 59 0.5
note 7 60 0.5
note 8 61 0.5
note 9 62 0.5
note 10 63 0.5
note 11 64 0.5
note 12 65 0.5
note 13 66 0.5
note 14 67 0.5
note 15 68 0.5
note 16 69 0.5
note 17 70 0.5
note 18 71 0.5
note 19 72 0.5
note 20 73 0.5
note 21 74 0.5
note 22 75 0.5
note 23 76 0.5
note 24 0 0.5
note 25 52 0.5
note 26 127 0.5
track snare
sample ../../build/samples/opzk_testkit5.aif
note 27 53 0.5
note 28 57 0.5
note 29 58 0.5
note 30 76 0.5
note 31 0 0.5
track perc
sample ../../build/samples/opzk_plain.aif
note 32 53 0.5
